module examples.layout_dma

# plans/M7.md item B: `@layout(dma)` — device-visible memory (03-hardware.md
# §3). Two real virtio-blk request structures: a four-field header whose
# offsets are all implicit (each field starts where the previous one ended,
# every one naturally aligned, so the compiler never has to invent a byte)
# and a one-byte status word.
#
# The *pool* these would live in — `own[P] T`, `DmaShared[P, L]`, and
# `img.dma_pool` — is plans/M7.md item D and does not exist yet; this case
# declares the bytes only.

@layout(dma, endian=little)
struct BlkReqHeader:
    kind: u32
    reserved: u32
    sector: u64


@layout(dma, endian=little)
struct BlkReqStatus:
    status: u8
